1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,900
Little Prince.

10
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,050
- Changshou.
- Ao Yi.

11
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:51,740
Changshou.

12
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,260
Little Prince.

13
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:52,900
Changshou.

14
00:01:53,790 --> 00:01:55,210
Help him up, guys.

15
00:01:55,230 --> 00:01:55,570
Got it.

16
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:56,210
Hurry.

17
00:02:10,430 --> 00:02:11,290
You...

18
00:02:11,750 --> 00:02:13,450
Nice acting.

19
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,450
Junior.

20
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,290
Senior.

21
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,940
Senior, you...

22
00:02:20,190 --> 00:02:20,610
Junior.

23
00:02:20,630 --> 00:02:21,980
Give Second Highness

24
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,130
a big thumbs-up for me.

25
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,610
What does that mean?

26
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:31,260
To the greatest rival

27
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:36,380
of my acting career.

28
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:37,690
Senior.

29
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:40,010
Senior?

30
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:41,500
Didn't catch a word.

31
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,290
Get him to the West Hall.

32
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,130
Hurry.

33
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:51,010
Little Prince?

34
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,610
Little Prince?

35
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,220
Human Clan's pathetic.

36
00:02:59,910 --> 00:03:01,060
That guy took

37
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:02,690
quite a fall today.

38
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:06,410
Second Prince dragged it out though.

39
00:03:06,430 --> 00:03:07,290
You don't get it.

40
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:10,100
Cat and mouse game.

41
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:12,260
He's Ancestral Dragon reborn.

42
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:15,690
No mortal can compare with him.

43
00:03:16,310 --> 00:03:17,500
Ancestral Dragon?

44
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,890
Look at you. So ignorant.

45
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:24,500
Second Prince is gifted.

46
00:03:24,910 --> 00:03:25,540
Word is

47
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,690
he bears a mark.

48
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,850
Called

49
00:03:29,430 --> 00:03:30,890
Dragon's Prophecy.

50
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:33,660
Sign of the chosen dragon.

51
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:35,340
In that case,

52
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,100
Second Prince's legit.

53
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:39,940
But the Dragon King once said

54
00:03:40,310 --> 00:03:40,940
fate

55
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,690
is unpredictable.

56
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:46,500
It may lift a clan to greatness,

57
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,690
or leave one buried in the wildness.

58
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,290
First Prince still rules.

59
00:03:54,940 --> 00:03:57,940
[Episode 7]

60
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,490
Enough.

61
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,490
Let's call it a day.

62
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:00,900
We mustn't tire the First Prince.

63
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,700
Your Highness.

64
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,170
You went

65
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:41,020
too far today.

66
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,900
Did I?

67
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:46,930
The King invited humans

68
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,290
to make peace.

69
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,460
And you were ordered to host them.

70
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,290
Why did you poison them?

71
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,220
Why?

72
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:54,170
Si'er.

73
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:57,220
Humans are snakes.

74
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,370
I just

75
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,660
taught them a lesson

76
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:02,610
to prove our dragon might.

77
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,100
Wrong about that?

78
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:06,410
Your Highness.

79
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,700
You'll rule the East Sea.

80
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,640
Acting like this

81
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,360
- will...
- Enough.

82
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,330
Leave.

83
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,490
I'm not in the mood to talk.

84
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:19,460
Not in the mood to talk?

85
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,460
How about a spar?

86
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,810
Spar?

87
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:33,250
I'm the Mermaid Princess.

88
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,660
My people are born fighters.

89
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:38,900
Our Pearl Elites

90
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:41,410
are East Sea's finest.

91
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,900
I'll spar with you.

92
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:46,250
Qualified enough?

93
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:51,900
Si'er.

94
00:06:52,270 --> 00:06:53,490
Look around.

95
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,700
We've sparred here since childhood.

96
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,250
You know

97
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,140
you can't beat me.

98
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:01,050
Oh yeah?

99
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:14,290
Take this.

100
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,340
The First Prince I knew

101
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:39,980
was brave and kind.

102
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,900
A young hero revered
across the Four Seas.

103
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,290
I loved you.

104
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:02,290
Convinced my tribe to ally

105
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:03,700
and agreed to marry you.

106
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,660
I thought

107
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:13,490
your bravery

108
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,100
would restore dragon glory
and guard the seas.

109
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:17,900
But now,

110
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:20,370
you are

111
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,900
cruel, selfish, and crazy.

112
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,410
You're a total stranger.

113
00:08:25,430 --> 00:08:25,850
You...

114
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,290
What happened to you?

115
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,490
Jiang Si'er.

116
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,220
Remember.

117
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:54,850
This marriage

118
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:57,460
keeps your tribe safe.

119
00:08:58,510 --> 00:08:59,530
So watch it

120
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,250
around me.

121
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,340
This isn't

122
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,100
the man I fell for.

123
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:28,650
Ascendance Sect, listen up.

124
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,250
After returning to your rooms tonight,

125
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:38,420
you must not wander about.

126
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,890
Any sounds you hear

127
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:43,060
are matters of the Dragon Palace.

128
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,530
None of your concern.

129
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:46,890
Do you understand?

130
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,890
Coming. Coming.

131
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,420
Ling'e.

132
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,300
Aunt, Senior.

133
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,980
Changshou's hurt bad.

134
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,420
How's he doing?

135
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,460
Not good.

136
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,300
Still hurting?

137
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,820
He knew he was outmatched

138
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,890
yet gave his all.

139
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,490
So noble.

140
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,580
He took a hit

141
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,220
for our sect.

142
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,610
Let us see him.

143
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:09,420
Well...

144
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,300
He's meditating right now.

145
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,820
I got this. Bye.

146
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,850
Wait. Senior.

147
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,180
Senior.

148
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,490
Wake up. Wake up.

149
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,850
Safe now. They left.

150
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,610
They're gone.

151
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,850
Senior.

152
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:30,650
You fought

153
00:10:30,670 --> 00:10:32,180
amazingly back there.

154
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,010
You didn't win

155
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,610
or lose the face of our sect.

156
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:36,850
You had it all under control.

157
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,300
You don't get it.

158
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:40,890
This fight

159
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,220
was the deadliest

160
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,300
of my life.

161
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,490
Deadliest?

162
00:10:46,510 --> 00:10:48,530
You almost won.

163
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:49,580
Yeah.

164
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,300
Winning is easy.

165
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:52,890
Losing is hard.

166
00:10:55,870 --> 00:10:57,890
I've laid low for years.

167
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,730
Never caught.

168
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:02,010
But Second Prince

169
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:04,060
saw my weak spot instantly.

170
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:07,340
Tried to expose me publicly.

171
00:11:09,910 --> 00:11:11,850
Overthinking much?

172
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,820
You're underthinking.

173
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,370
Out of everyone

174
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:17,010
of Ascendance Sect,

175
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:18,220
why pick me?

176
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:20,250
He targeted me.

177
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,060
He knew Kuai Si was watching,

178
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,700
and that I tricked Kuai Si

179
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,610
and dared not show my cultivation
before him.

180
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,490
So he threw the fight

181
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:30,300
to make Kuai Si suspicious

182
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:32,370
and use him

183
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,300
to kill me.

184
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,420
What?

185
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:38,010
He's that evil?

186
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,490
Terrifying.

187
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:43,820
So ruthless and scheming.

188
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:46,460
Never seen anything like it.

189
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,250
But how did he know

190
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:52,490
about my hidden cultivation?

191
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,370
Right.

192
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:55,530
Besides me,

193
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,220
who else knows?

194
00:11:58,670 --> 00:11:59,890
When we entered,

195
00:11:59,910 --> 00:12:01,420
an extra spiritual sense appeared.

196
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,890
A mole in the palace?

197
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,490
By the way,

198
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,610
back on the arena,

199
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:12,530
did you perform some art?

200
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,730
Like turning back time?

201
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:16,890
Am I crazy?

202
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:17,850
But why do I...

203
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:18,420
Junior.

204
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:21,250
Ao Yi hides a deeper scheme.

205
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:22,820
I'm checking it out.

206
00:12:23,790 --> 00:12:24,610
Cover for me.

207
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:25,820
But Elder Kuai Si

208
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:28,220
said no going out.

209
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:35,010
I have a grand dream.

210
00:12:36,390 --> 00:12:40,060
Break free from this golden cage.

211
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:44,300
Awaken every lost soul.

212
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,060
Make every dragon

213
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:49,530
reclaim its true self.

214
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,010
Ruin lies ahead.

215
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,820
Only destruction brings rebirth.

216
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:00,010
And that grand gravedigger

217
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:03,420
is you.

218
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,100
Needs more drama.

219
00:13:13,510 --> 00:13:14,850
And that grand gravedigger

220
00:13:16,870 --> 00:13:17,820
is you.

221
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:20,490
Who?

222
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,300
Who let you in?

223
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,300
This fortress was built with my blood.

224
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,850
Show some respect.

225
00:13:25,870 --> 00:13:26,980
Respect.

226
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,060
What fortress?

227
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,940
This quilt of yours.

228
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,730
I just changed it this afternoon.

229
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:32,820
Little Prince, still awake?

230
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:33,770
I...

231
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,980
Stop calling me Little Prince.

232
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,060
I'm a big dragon now.

233
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,820
Besides, I have a reason.

234
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:42,100
I'm sealing my sleepiness

235
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,220
to admire the bleak moonlight tonight.

236
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,420
Big day today.

237
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,490
Need your sleep.

238
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,530
Hold it right there.

239
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,530
Let me ask you something.

240
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,940
Did you go out and ask around?

241
00:13:54,270 --> 00:13:55,100
How did

242
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:56,890
my loss go today?

243
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,650
Was it mind-blowing?

244
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:02,530
Did it shock

245
00:14:02,550 --> 00:14:04,490
everyone's minds?

246
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:05,850
Little Prince,

247
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,250
you are mistaken.

248
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,300
You won.

249
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:10,890
I...

250
00:14:11,870 --> 00:14:12,530
I won?

251
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:13,370
Of course.

252
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,300
They say you blasted

253
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,460
that human away.

254
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:19,220
Right. A mere human

255
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,820
stands no chance.

256
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,370
Heard you got so hyped

257
00:14:22,390 --> 00:14:24,300
that you passed out.

258
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:25,890
I...

259
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,100
How could I have won?

260
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,060
Little Prince, your bed is ready.

261
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,300
Let us tuck you in.

262
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:34,940
No.

263
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:38,100
My bedside

264
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,490
needs no one.

265
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,010
My sleeping posture

266
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,530
is too awesome for your eyes.

267
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:44,890
What's so funny?

268
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,420
Fine.

269
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:48,490
We'll leave then.

270
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,490
Little Prince.

271
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,610
Don't overthink again

272
00:14:51,630 --> 00:14:52,850
about that weird thing.

273
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:54,820
Leave already.

274
00:14:55,030 --> 00:14:56,490
I'm a big dragon now.

275
00:14:56,790 --> 00:14:57,820
Not scared at all.

276
00:14:58,630 --> 00:14:59,490
Not a bit.

277
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,700
Good job. Rest now.

278
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,340
Little Prince is so stubborn.

279
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:31,220
Moonlight underwater?

280
00:15:31,670 --> 00:15:32,650
Told you

281
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:35,220
no human storybooks for him.

282
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,940
Look, he's ruined.

283
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,060
Not really.

284
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,850
Sounds cool to me.

285
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,490
He's a master strategist.

286
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,010
He must be prepared.

287
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:11,490
I'll use the side gate and close in.

288
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:17,940
There you are. I waited ages.

289
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:21,530
Your Highness.

290
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:23,530
You waited for me?

291
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:24,820
Of course.

292
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:27,100
Yuhu, Luye, and Liuxia are away.

293
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:28,220
Just you.

294
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:28,980
Come in.

295
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,490
Yes.

296
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:35,940
You're new here?

297
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,730
What do you mean?

298
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,490
Alright. Hit it.

299
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,420
Since you asked,

300
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,370
then I'll...

301
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,130
Sing me a song first.

302
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:48,890
Sing?

303
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,060
What?

304
00:16:53,910 --> 00:16:55,420
I'm tone-deaf.

305
00:16:55,630 --> 00:16:57,340
Don't wanna ruin your ears.

306
00:16:59,150 --> 00:16:59,940
Fine.

307
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,250
A story then.

308
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,340
No ghost stories.

309
00:17:03,510 --> 00:17:04,700
Are you...

310
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,010
I'm not scared.

311
00:17:06,070 --> 00:17:06,900
I'm just worried

312
00:17:07,510 --> 00:17:09,530
you won't dare walk back.

313
00:17:11,110 --> 00:17:11,900
Right.

314
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,420
Dragons are so powerful.

315
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:17,090
Why fear ghosts?

316
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,660
Of course we do.

317
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:19,900
Come here.

318
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,490
Over here.

319
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,330
Let me tell you.

320
00:17:27,750 --> 00:17:29,010
Under the palace,

321
00:17:29,030 --> 00:17:30,730
there are ancient vengeful ghosts.

322
00:17:31,590 --> 00:17:32,860
At midnight,

323
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,900
on the West Hall waste,

324
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,290
you can hear them wailing.

325
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,220
Naturally,

326
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,250
I'm not scared.

327
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:45,420
Ghosts are less scary than humans.

328
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:48,810
Humans today

329
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:50,620
were total pushovers.

330
00:17:50,790 --> 00:17:53,220
Didn't you beat one

331
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,380
today?

332
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,460
You don't get it.

333
00:17:56,030 --> 00:17:57,980
Kings rise and fall up there.

334
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,420
So many legends.

335
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:01,290
If humans are weak,

336
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:03,010
why were we pushed to the sea?

337
00:18:03,030 --> 00:18:03,940
What does that make us?

338
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,420
Worse than pushovers.

339
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:09,290
Then,

340
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:11,810
why challenge that human

341
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:13,090
today?

342
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:14,420
Great question.

343
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:16,860
Finally someone asked.

344
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:20,250
I have a dream.

345
00:18:21,590 --> 00:18:24,490
Break free from this golden cage.

346
00:18:24,510 --> 00:18:26,730
Awaken every lost soul.

347
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:27,860
Make every dragon

348
00:18:28,030 --> 00:18:29,940
reclaim its true self.

349
00:18:30,310 --> 00:18:31,700
Ruin lies ahead.

350
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:34,700
Only destruction brings rebirth.

351
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,900
And that grand gravedigger

352
00:18:39,030 --> 00:18:40,050
is you.

353
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:43,940
Me?

354
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:46,010
Me. Sitting beside you.

355
00:18:47,110 --> 00:18:47,940
Get it?

356
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:52,290
Sounds cool, but no.

357
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,050
We dragons

358
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,660
used to rule.

359
00:18:57,720 --> 00:18:59,700
Now we're stuck in the past.

360
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:01,290
That's why we're weak.

361
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:03,460
We must shatter dragon pride.

362
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,180
Only then

363
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:06,460
can dragons rise again.

364
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,980
So you plan to...

365
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:12,090
As the Second Prince of East Sea,

366
00:19:12,110 --> 00:19:14,290
I'd lose to the weakest human.

367
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:15,090
Only then

368
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:17,700
will dragons learn shame and fight.

369
00:19:18,310 --> 00:19:19,660
For this,

370
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,250
you'd sacrifice your life?

371
00:19:21,310 --> 00:19:22,250
For a dream,

372
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,010
what's a life?

373
00:19:25,110 --> 00:19:26,050
Then,

374
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:28,980
you picked him because...

375
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,090
He's the weakest, obviously.

376
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:36,490
Your logic is

377
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:39,940
wild, twisted, and totally nuts.

378
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:41,730
What'd you say?

379
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:47,530
Your Highness. Tell me.

380
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:50,980
What if you lost today

381
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,490
and war broke out?

382
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,090
If humans lose,

383
00:19:56,110 --> 00:19:58,090
won't that make dragons more arrogant?

384
00:19:58,270 --> 00:19:59,900
And if the Dragons lose,

385
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,700
your name tarnished

386
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:04,220
and the race branded as monsters,

387
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,460
what then, Your Highness?

388
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:09,010
Never thought of that, huh?

389
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:10,570
I...

390
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:12,900
Of course I did.

391
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:13,700
Just...

392
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,980
not that deep.

393
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,290
I'll leave you to rest.

394
00:20:24,310 --> 00:20:25,140
Leaving already?

395
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,050
Won't tuck me in?

396
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,980
Got stuff to do.

397
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:30,860
Can't sleep without it.

398
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:34,010
Mostly because of the wailing outside.

399
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:38,090
Wanna go to sleep?

400
00:20:39,110 --> 00:20:39,900
Easy.

401
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,290
You...

402
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,140
Good stuff.

403
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:58,180
Thought you were tough.

404
00:20:59,160 --> 00:20:59,940
You almost

405
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:01,290
got me killed.

406
00:21:06,270 --> 00:21:06,860
This kid

407
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,660
is a prince.

408
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:11,050
He might have a clue
about the Sea-Calming Pillar.

409
00:21:11,590 --> 00:21:12,980
Let me check.

410
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:17,170
"A Tale of Witches and Demons."

411
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:22,530
"The Making of a Dao Ancestor."

412
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:24,920
"Battle Through the Netherworld."

413
00:21:24,950 --> 00:21:26,340
"Secret History
of the Three Firmaments."

414
00:21:26,590 --> 00:21:29,090
What are these trash fiction?

415
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:33,290
My Future Self.

416
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:35,380
By Ao Yi. Age 4.

417
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,490
No wonder he's...

418
00:21:38,510 --> 00:21:39,530
Watch me

419
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:41,420
shatter the old dark...

420
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:42,770
Hopeless. Truly hopeless.

421
00:21:42,790 --> 00:21:45,940
And hold up a new dawn.

422
00:21:49,030 --> 00:21:51,250
Lotus Hall Treasures?

423
00:21:51,250 --> 00:21:52,060
[Dragon Palace Lotus Hall Treasures]

424
00:21:52,260 --> 00:21:54,260
[Flower Festival Bracelet]

425
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:56,700
Senior.

426
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:58,490
Why aren't you back yet?

427
00:21:58,590 --> 00:21:59,660
What if

428
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,330
someone bursts in?

429
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,290
Um...

430
00:22:06,310 --> 00:22:07,810
Elder Kuai Si said,

431
00:22:07,830 --> 00:22:09,220
no one's allowed in.

432
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,290
Whatever they're doing

433
00:22:10,310 --> 00:22:11,090
it's Dragon business.

434
00:22:11,110 --> 00:22:12,290
Nothing to do with us.

435
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:23,330
Elder Kuai Si.

436
00:22:23,350 --> 00:22:24,860
Lan Ling'e?

437
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,620
You...

438
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,980
Why are you here?

439
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:30,570
I...

440
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:33,090
Is this your room?

441
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:34,380
No.

442
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,860
Senior got hurt.

443
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:37,220
I'm just taking care of him.

444
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:39,180
I...

445
00:22:46,350 --> 00:22:47,730
What brings you by

446
00:22:47,750 --> 00:22:48,980
so late, Elder?

447
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:53,250
He was hurt fighting the Second Prince.

448
00:22:53,550 --> 00:22:57,050
Checking on him as team leader.

449
00:22:57,590 --> 00:22:59,180
Is there a problem?

450
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,660
Not at all.

451
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:03,490
But Senior's still out.

452
00:23:03,830 --> 00:23:05,770
Maybe come back later?

453
00:23:05,790 --> 00:23:06,900
I'll call you when he wakes.

454
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,530
Very well.

455
00:23:11,350 --> 00:23:12,180
Fine.

456
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:15,900
Who's there?

457
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:16,490
What?

458
00:23:18,030 --> 00:23:19,010
Elder, no.

459
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,330
Senior.

460
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:26,250
That's...

461
00:23:28,070 --> 00:23:29,490
He's not awake yet.

462
00:23:29,590 --> 00:23:31,090
Elder, maybe leave first?

463
00:23:31,110 --> 00:23:32,770
I'll call you when he wakes.

464
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:38,180
Don't.

465
00:23:41,270 --> 00:23:42,660
I'd like you to take my pulse too.

466
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,220
Feeling weak myself.

467
00:23:57,270 --> 00:23:58,660
How can this be?

468
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:02,420
His pulse is total chaos.

469
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:06,700
Could he really be badly hurt?

470
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,090
Of course he is.

471
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:12,380
Everyone saw it.

472
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,490
My senior is so weak.

473
00:24:13,550 --> 00:24:14,330
The Second Prince

474
00:24:14,350 --> 00:24:15,770
just swooshed him away.

475
00:24:28,270 --> 00:24:30,660
His cultivation is trash indeed.

476
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:33,570
Take good care of him.

477
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,490
Thank you, Elder.

478
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:40,250
Oh, right.

479
00:24:40,830 --> 00:24:43,660
Don't wander around lately.

480
00:24:44,350 --> 00:24:45,050
Understood.

481
00:24:46,750 --> 00:24:47,660
This way, Elder.

482
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:50,010
Smart kid.

483
00:24:50,030 --> 00:24:51,380
Just a bit slick.

484
00:24:52,510 --> 00:24:55,660
Take care, Elder.

485
00:25:02,790 --> 00:25:03,530
Senior.

486
00:25:04,110 --> 00:25:04,770
Senior.

487
00:25:08,830 --> 00:25:09,490
Senior.

488
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:10,860
Elder Kuai

489
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,810
nearly scared me senseless.

490
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:13,980
Seriously.

491
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:16,620
Good thing I took Seven-Injury Pills

492
00:25:17,070 --> 00:25:18,530
to wreck my organs.

493
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:20,700
How are you feeling now?

494
00:25:27,350 --> 00:25:28,490
Took Seven-Cure Powder.

495
00:25:28,790 --> 00:25:30,490
I'll be fine soon.

496
00:25:31,590 --> 00:25:34,250
Senior, you play it safe.

497
00:25:37,070 --> 00:25:38,180
What'd you find out?

498
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:40,460
Where's the treasure hall?

499
00:25:40,480 --> 00:25:42,090
Can we swipe it all?

500
00:25:43,510 --> 00:25:45,380
The treasures are in Lotus Hall.

501
00:25:45,510 --> 00:25:46,490
Lotus Hall.

502
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,290
This

503
00:25:48,110 --> 00:25:49,050
is the catalog.

504
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:51,770
[Dragon Palace Lotus Hall Treasures]
Any single item in here

505
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:53,250
could fund us

506
00:25:53,590 --> 00:25:56,050
for 20,000 years.

507
00:25:57,310 --> 00:25:58,530
We'll be rich.

508
00:25:59,750 --> 00:26:01,420
Senior, which one do you want?

509
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:02,660
This one? This one?

510
00:26:02,660 --> 00:26:04,460
[Chiming Ring]

511
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:06,530
Lately,

512
00:26:06,550 --> 00:26:09,570
Fairy Yunxiao's been hunting

513
00:26:09,790 --> 00:26:11,980
for the Sea-Calming Pillar.

514
00:26:13,030 --> 00:26:14,730
I'm not after any treasure.

515
00:26:16,310 --> 00:26:17,140
But a person.

516
00:26:39,980 --> 00:26:44,060
[Hall of United Spirits]

517
00:26:50,070 --> 00:26:51,290
Built a barrier, huh?

518
00:26:53,310 --> 00:26:53,980
Here goes.

519
00:26:59,750 --> 00:27:02,290
Junior Qi Yuan, quite the mood.

520
00:27:02,310 --> 00:27:03,460
It's midnight.

521
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:05,770
Fish are asleep and you're fishing?

522
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:11,860
They sleep, and I'll do my thing.

523
00:27:12,030 --> 00:27:13,140
Fishing

524
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:14,980
is about willing bites.

525
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,380
Here to see Changshou?

526
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:19,620
I know the team returns tomorrow.

527
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,900
Just got that chess itch.

528
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,330
Let me see

529
00:27:25,350 --> 00:27:27,420
what you caught.

530
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,420
Junior.

531
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:37,860
Once this dries,

532
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:39,420
you can still wear it.

533
00:27:42,790 --> 00:27:43,860
All treasures.

534
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:46,860
Gotta ask.

535
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:48,660
How did you catch this?

536
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:51,250
Got everything here

537
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:52,860
except fish.

538
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:57,050
How long you been fishing?

539
00:27:59,830 --> 00:28:01,220
For hours?

540
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:05,380
Two days and nights.

541
00:28:06,590 --> 00:28:08,570
Since those two kids left,

542
00:28:08,790 --> 00:28:11,290
I haven't moved an inch.

543
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,380
Two days and nights?

544
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,180
Your butt must be numb.

545
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:18,290
Why didn't you go back to rest?

546
00:28:18,310 --> 00:28:20,090
I want to.

547
00:28:24,030 --> 00:28:25,940
But I can't.

548
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:32,860
Interesting.

549
00:28:33,550 --> 00:28:34,420
Interesting.

550
00:28:39,510 --> 00:28:40,810
Off you go.

551
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:48,490
A linked maze formation.

552
00:28:49,070 --> 00:28:50,770
Entry only, no exit.

553
00:28:50,790 --> 00:28:52,900
Changshou built this?

554
00:28:53,110 --> 00:28:54,490
Who else?

555
00:28:54,750 --> 00:28:55,980
That little brat

556
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:58,090
secretly put up a formation

557
00:28:58,400 --> 00:29:00,570
with layers

558
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:02,010
upon layers,

559
00:29:02,030 --> 00:29:03,490
locking this place down airtight.

560
00:29:03,510 --> 00:29:04,490
I was just hungry.

561
00:29:04,510 --> 00:29:05,980
Came out to grab fish or shrimp

562
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:06,940
to fill my belly.

563
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:08,730
Ended up trapped in the yard.

564
00:29:08,750 --> 00:29:09,770
Can't get inside.

565
00:29:09,830 --> 00:29:11,140
In my room,

566
00:29:11,160 --> 00:29:12,860
my socks aren't hung up.

567
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,770
Why didn't you say so earlier?

568
00:29:15,310 --> 00:29:16,330
You didn't ask.

569
00:29:16,350 --> 00:29:16,810
I...

570
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:18,700
Fair enough.

571
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:20,420
So you mean,

572
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,980
you can't even get inside?

573
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:23,980
If I could, I'd be in by now.

574
00:29:37,350 --> 00:29:39,180
Don't bother.

575
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:41,860
Can't get in. The yard's huge.

576
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,380
Just crash somewhere

577
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:44,810
till they come back.

578
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:48,860
Junior,

579
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,900
you gave up too soon.

580
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:52,570
Changshou only

581
00:29:52,590 --> 00:29:55,220
cultivated for decades.

582
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:57,660
No matter how sharp his tricks

583
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:58,940
or clever his traps,

584
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,900
what else could he have?

585
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:01,570
Right?

586
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:02,460
Just watch me

587
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:04,490
break through

588
00:30:04,510 --> 00:30:06,380
and rescue you.

589
00:30:07,510 --> 00:30:08,140
Here we go.

590
00:31:27,060 --> 00:31:35,300
[Lost?]

591
00:32:45,590 --> 00:32:47,140
How did you end up like this?

592
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,980
Why bother?

593
00:32:49,270 --> 00:32:50,570
Should've listened to me.

594
00:32:50,590 --> 00:32:52,380
Just sleep here.

595
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:54,250
You're bleeding.

596
00:32:57,550 --> 00:32:58,980
To think I, Jiu Wu,

597
00:33:03,830 --> 00:33:06,700
roamed the realm for millennia

598
00:33:08,510 --> 00:33:09,620
and never

599
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:14,290
suffered such humiliation.

600
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:23,490
Alright.

601
00:33:24,110 --> 00:33:25,140
Two more days.

602
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:27,490
They will be back.

603
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:31,570
Wonder what they're up to.

604
00:33:32,550 --> 00:33:33,250
You know...

605
00:33:33,270 --> 00:33:34,810
Two more days?

606
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:58,940
Senior?

607
00:34:01,550 --> 00:34:02,140
Senior?

608
00:34:03,310 --> 00:34:04,090
Junior.

609
00:34:04,590 --> 00:34:05,700
How is Senior?

610
00:34:06,070 --> 00:34:06,620
Senior's

611
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:09,210
drifting in and out.

612
00:34:09,230 --> 00:34:10,690
Although his life's not in danger,

613
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,460
but,

614
00:34:11,710 --> 00:34:12,490
he's not fit to go out.

615
00:34:12,510 --> 00:34:14,090
Just stays in bed all day.

616
00:34:15,710 --> 00:34:18,900
He sacrificed so much for our sect.

617
00:34:19,710 --> 00:34:20,690
Too much.

618
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:24,980
Senior set an example for us.

619
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,130
We can't slack off.

620
00:34:26,710 --> 00:34:27,490
That's right.

621
00:34:31,590 --> 00:34:32,610
Nice acting.

622
00:34:33,550 --> 00:34:34,210
Senior.

623
00:34:34,510 --> 00:34:36,210
Keep up. Don't look at me.

624
00:34:44,300 --> 00:34:49,060
[Outside Lotus Hall]

625
00:35:06,320 --> 00:35:08,340
Seven-Star Ice Coral.

626
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:09,940
Look at the quality.

627
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,260
If it were exchanged for Spirit Stones,

628
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:11,860
could buy

629
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:13,690
6,666 Jade Divisions.

630
00:35:13,710 --> 00:35:15,380
Eyes front. Don't talk to me.

631
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:22,860
Your Highness.

632
00:35:28,550 --> 00:35:29,900
Been waiting for you all.

633
00:35:29,930 --> 00:35:30,670
Junior.

634
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:36,090
What're you looking at?

635
00:35:36,550 --> 00:35:37,690
Is it that good?

636
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:42,130
Stuff like this?

637
00:35:42,590 --> 00:35:45,530
Lotus Hall has tons of them.

638
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:47,260
If you guys like,

639
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,490
go in and help yourselves.

640
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:53,490
As expected of First Prince.

641
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:55,380
Filthy rich

642
00:35:55,710 --> 00:35:58,570
and flexing it.

643
00:35:58,800 --> 00:35:59,570
Well...

644
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:00,860
At yesterday's banquet

645
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:03,170
there were misunderstandings.

646
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:05,610
His Majesty ordered

647
00:36:05,630 --> 00:36:08,090
Lotus Hall open today.

648
00:36:08,280 --> 00:36:09,860
Palace treasures will compensate

649
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:12,130
for yesterday's offense.

650
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:13,900
Compensate?

651
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,490
You seafood

652
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:17,090
got any real treasure?

653
00:36:17,110 --> 00:36:18,740
Real treasure?

654
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:21,340
My little turtle is off-limits.

655
00:36:22,230 --> 00:36:25,420
All treasures inside are fair game.

656
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:29,090
Everyone here can step inside.

657
00:36:31,190 --> 00:36:33,300
Even the corals outside are priceless.

658
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:35,460
Imagine what's inside.

659
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:36,820
Senior, wait up.

660
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:38,460
I'm ready.

661
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,210
What's wrong, Senior?

662
00:36:42,230 --> 00:36:43,860
Isn't this what we waited for?

663
00:36:44,230 --> 00:36:46,300
No free lunch in this world.

664
00:36:48,710 --> 00:36:49,490
Uncle.

665
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:57,010
Must you ask me for everything?

666
00:36:57,030 --> 00:36:59,530
Are you three-year-olds?

667
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:01,980
Don't hold back.

668
00:37:02,110 --> 00:37:04,090
Take as much as you can.

669
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:05,820
Yes, Uncle.

670
00:37:08,360 --> 00:37:09,940
Junior, you...

671
00:37:10,030 --> 00:37:10,940
Together.

672
00:37:11,030 --> 00:37:12,010
Easier in a team.

673
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:13,170
Exactly.

674
00:37:16,030 --> 00:37:17,380
Go on.

675
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:29,610
What happened?

676
00:37:30,360 --> 00:37:31,090
Uncle.

677
00:37:31,110 --> 00:37:33,090
There are two brutes inside.
Incredibly strong.

678
00:37:33,110 --> 00:37:34,900
We couldn't hold them off.

679
00:37:35,070 --> 00:37:36,380
Beaten so badly.

680
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:37,690
They must be

681
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:39,340
high-rank Celestial Immortals.

682
00:37:39,790 --> 00:37:40,660
Not to be underestimated.

683
00:37:41,030 --> 00:37:41,650
Get up.

684
00:37:43,110 --> 00:37:44,130
My bad.

685
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:45,650
I forgot to warn you all.

686
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:48,650
Lotus Hall is restricted.

687
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:50,490
Naturally, it has guards.

688
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:51,690
With guards,

689
00:37:51,710 --> 00:37:53,940
clashes are bound to happen.

690
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:55,690
Want riches?

691
00:37:56,070 --> 00:37:57,690
Prove your worth.

692
00:37:57,710 --> 00:38:00,460
Yet blades show no mercy.

693
00:38:00,550 --> 00:38:02,210
If you get hurt,

694
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:05,300
don't hold a grudge.

695
00:38:08,670 --> 00:38:09,980
Our East Sea Dragon Palace

696
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:13,010
has Four Great Warriors.

697
00:38:14,110 --> 00:38:15,980
Yecha and Jinli,

698
00:38:16,440 --> 00:38:17,490
you've already

699
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:19,420
seen their valor.

700
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:20,690
The other two,

701
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:23,170
Captain Frog and Warrior Eel,

702
00:38:23,190 --> 00:38:26,300
are built like mountains.

703
00:38:27,590 --> 00:38:28,260
Everyone,

704
00:38:28,880 --> 00:38:29,650
please proceed.

705
00:38:31,960 --> 00:38:32,740
No need to fear.

706
00:38:32,760 --> 00:38:35,490
They'll match your cultivation level.

707
00:38:35,510 --> 00:38:36,980
Junior, I will scout ahead.

708
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:38,170
What is it, Elder Kuai?

709
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:39,900
Go on.

710
00:38:42,510 --> 00:38:43,420
After all that fuss,

711
00:38:43,710 --> 00:38:44,740
the Human Clan

712
00:38:45,150 --> 00:38:47,490
are all cowardly rats.

713
00:38:48,710 --> 00:38:51,610
Greedy yet terrified of death.

714
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:53,090
Now they stand here, frozen.

715
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:55,300
A laughingstock to dragons.

716
00:38:57,320 --> 00:38:58,980
You can endure that?

717
00:39:01,710 --> 00:39:02,690
Xuanya is willing to go.

718
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:08,690
Senior.

719
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:10,740
Haven't you not recovered?

720
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:12,490
Don't go.

721
00:39:13,190 --> 00:39:14,340
I volunteer.

722
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:16,210
Xuanya, don't be reckless.

723
00:39:16,230 --> 00:39:17,090
Those guys inside

724
00:39:17,110 --> 00:39:18,860
are centuries ahead of you.

725
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:20,090
Let him go.

726
00:39:23,150 --> 00:39:24,940
I'm the team leader.

727
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:27,210
Must oversee the big picture.

728
00:39:29,230 --> 00:39:30,900
I never imagined

729
00:39:31,710 --> 00:39:33,530
that Warden Jiang of Discipline Hall,

730
00:39:33,550 --> 00:39:35,460
a person of such noble integrity,

731
00:39:35,480 --> 00:39:37,300
would have her top prodigy

732
00:39:37,550 --> 00:39:40,210
so enchanted by worldly trinkets.

733
00:39:40,760 --> 00:39:41,570
Xuanya

734
00:39:42,070 --> 00:39:42,780
volunteers.

735
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:57,740
If you insist,

736
00:39:59,510 --> 00:40:00,860
then go.

737
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:01,780
You...

738
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:05,780
Xuanya.

739
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:06,530
Xuanya.

740
00:40:10,670 --> 00:40:12,860
I never knew what this sword meant,

741
00:40:13,070 --> 00:40:14,570
nor why I drew it.

742
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:15,780
The sword is

743
00:40:17,280 --> 00:40:18,300
where the heart is.

744
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:20,860
Senior's sword was never steel,

745
00:40:21,150 --> 00:40:23,130
but the justice in a Qi refiner's heart.

746
00:40:23,630 --> 00:40:26,050
Strength comes not from the sword,

747
00:40:26,070 --> 00:40:27,170
but from the righteous heart.

748
00:40:29,030 --> 00:40:30,820
Stupid Kuai Si.

749
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:32,300
More dead rival prodigies,

750
00:40:32,320 --> 00:40:33,340
more he laughs inside.

751
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:35,900
Impressive, Ling'e.

752
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:37,130
Usually you look so money-grubbing,

753
00:40:37,710 --> 00:40:38,820
but you're quite sensible.

754
00:40:39,550 --> 00:40:40,210
You bet.

755
00:40:40,320 --> 00:40:42,340
Look who taught me.

756
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:44,740
What? Something back there?

757
00:40:45,710 --> 00:40:46,490
Nothing.

758
00:40:46,960 --> 00:40:47,980
Stupid Kuai Si.

759
00:40:48,940 --> 00:40:52,220
[Captain Frog & Warrior Eel]

760
00:40:55,030 --> 00:40:56,780
Youqin Xuanya, Ascendance Sect disciple.

761
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:58,490
Please enlighten me.

762
00:41:37,220 --> 00:41:43,000
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

763
00:41:43,670 --> 00:41:50,370
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

764
00:41:51,900 --> 00:41:57,950
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

765
00:41:58,580 --> 00:42:05,030
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

766
00:42:05,770 --> 00:42:12,890
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

767
00:42:13,270 --> 00:42:20,170
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

768
00:42:20,550 --> 00:42:27,900
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

769
00:42:27,900 --> 00:42:35,070
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

770
00:42:51,210 --> 00:42:56,380
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

771
00:42:57,470 --> 00:43:04,490
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

772
00:43:05,680 --> 00:43:11,620
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

773
00:43:12,320 --> 00:43:19,400
♪Alas, our story is short♪

774
00:43:19,740 --> 00:43:26,850
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

775
00:43:27,170 --> 00:43:33,650
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

776
00:43:34,430 --> 00:43:41,640
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

777
00:43:42,030 --> 00:43:49,850
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
